-- test: the loop variable is a plain binding, a loop visits a list or a range of integers, an outer binding taken in the body is taken in every iteration, one revived only in the body stays taken since the loop may not run, the body is a block of statements, and a call with `edit` is a statement in the body, not the source (spec/17 §1, §3)
-- spec: spec/17 §1, §3
-- expect: error U2019 at src/for_rules.una:17:5
-- expect: error U2001 at src/for_rules.una:22:12
-- expect: error U2001 at src/for_rules.una:28:16
-- expect: error U2017 at src/for_rules.una:37:22
